insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('1cb81c07-479b-5701-bb8b-89b72db0a424', 'rg4-word-parts-p01', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g4-word-parts'), null,
        '3-5', $q$The Night Sky Club$q$, $q$Every Friday, the Night Sky Club met on the school field after dark. Ms. Okafor carried a long telescope out of the supply room. The students helped her unpack it from its padded case.

Before the stars came out, Ms. Okafor gave the group a preview of what they would see. She showed them a chart of the moon and pointed to its biggest craters.

Tomas was the first to look through the eyepiece. He gasped. The moon looked so close that he could see shadows inside the craters. "It looks like I could reach out and touch it," he said.

Next, Priya took a turn. She was careful not to bump the telescope, because even a small push would move the moon out of view. When the moon slipped away anyway, Ms. Okafor showed her how to reset the telescope and point it again.

At the end of the night, the students wrote in their sky journals. Tomas drew the moon and labeled the craters. Priya wrote that the night was unforgettable. She could not wait to come back the next Friday.$q$, 'draft')
